OL,3,GNEWSATaxi firm helps charity in 'urgent
OL,4,Aneed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA taxi firm has helped a disability
OL,7,Fcharity in "urgent need" of
OL,8,Fwheelchair-friendly travel options.
OL,10,FCharity Les Amis, in Jersey, said it
OL,11,Fwas forced to stop using its two
OL,12,Fwheelchair-accessible vehicles after
OL,13,Fthey "reached the end of their useful
OL,14,Flife" - with replacements due to take
OL,15,Fsix months.
OL,17,FIt said taxi service Ryde had partnered
OL,18,Fwith the charity to provide discounted
OL,19,Frates and a simple booking system for
OL,20,Fcare workers to use.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
