OL,3,GNEWSATaxi firm helps charity in 'urgent
OL,4,Aneed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlie Petulla, co-founder and
OL,7,Fdirector of Ryde, said the firm made a
OL,8,F"significant investment" in two new,
OL,9,Ffully electric wheelchair-accessible
OL,10,Fvehicles, alongside ongoing specialist
OL,11,Ftraining for its drivers.
